araName":"希尔","text":"[show]米托拉，不用那么急。这里还有很多。[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_22"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"bright":0.6,"alpha":0,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara3","x":676,"scaleX":0.9,"y":-264.80000000000007,"scaleY":0.9,"img":"chara002_2","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":0,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"layer":"chara1","x":67,"scaleX":1,"y":-215,"scaleY":1,"img":"chara001_0","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":1,"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-331.5,"scaleX":1.5,"y":-187.5,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":0,"noIn":false,"layer":"back","x":-111.5,"scaleX":1,"y":0,"scaleY":1,"img":"evcg_00_0","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":1,"transTime":1000,"noIn":false,"layer":"back","x":-111.5,"scaleX":1,"y":0,"scaleY":1,"img":"evcg_00_0","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":1000},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"time":1000,"type":"time"},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_23"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara1"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":1,"transTime":1000,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-111.5,"scaleX":1,"y":0,"scaleY":1,"img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":1000},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]因为真的很好吃嘛！希尔你也来一串！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_24"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":1,"transTime":1000,"noIn":false,"layer":"bg","x":-331.5,"scaleX":1.5,"y":-187.5,"scaleY":1.5,"img":"bgblack","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":1000},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"charaName":"希尔","text":"[show]啊，谢谢你……米托拉。啊姆……[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_25"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"希尔","text":"[show]……嗯，真美味。本就焦香四溢的烤肉，[r]配上滑嫩鲜美的蘑菇，真让人欲罢不能。[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_26"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嘿嘿～是吧。可别小看生存专家的独家秘方！[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_27"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]……和其他人一起吃东西，还是在这“深渊”里的头一次呢。[r]有个伴儿，还真挺不错的。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_28"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"希尔","text":"[show]“深渊”……是这里\u0013的名字吗？[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_29"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嗯呐。人们说这里是个很大很大的盆地，[r]不止有草原，还有森林、湖泊，甚至还有好大一座火山呢。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_30"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]可惜我一个人光生存下来就已经精疲力尽了。[r]有机会的话，还真想到这些地方去看看。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_31"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"希尔","text":"[show]你一直一个人住在野外？[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_32"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嗯～算是吧。我没有来到这里之前的记忆，[r]说这几年一直一个人住在这也不算错。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_33"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"希尔","text":"[show]没有记忆……？[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_34"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嗯～大概就是那样吧？在附近苏醒，发现自己什么都想不起来，[r]又饿又渴，还差点被魔物吃掉，千辛万苦才找到这座庇护所……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_35"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]哇，掐指一算，一晃几年都过去了。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_38"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]可别说我啦，你比我可奇怪多了吧。什么人类王国，[r]什么追兵什么遗迹，还炸掉了山头，引来一堆魔物拆了我的家……[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_39"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]啊，我也不是在怪你啦～[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_40"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"希尔","text":"[show]……呃。我知道了啦。就像昨天说的，我会担起责任修好营地……[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_41"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]我就勉为其难，给你一个可以休息的铺位～[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_42"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"希尔","text":"[show]这就是昨晚我们订下的“契约”……[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_43"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]嘿嘿，我也是有样学样。至于你说缺少的材料，我们明早就动身去找。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_44"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"希尔","text":"[show]嗯。而且还要找到那群角布林的盘踞地。[r]如果放任不管，日后它们一定会成为营地的威胁。[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_45"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]没错。我们要再去找点人帮忙，给它们点教训。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_46"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]好啦，肚子也填饱了。好好休息，明天还有活要干呢。[r]说好的铺位我来给你整～晚上可不许讲梦话哦。[l][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_47"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"希尔","text":"[show]不会的啦。大概。[l][cm]","nameSide":"right"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_48"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"charaName":"米托拉","text":"[show]不许大概！是不许！[l][hide][cm]","nameSide":"left"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_20"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"bright":1,"alpha":0,"transTime":1000,"noIn":false,"layer":"back","x":-111.5,"scaleX":1,"y":0,"scaleY":1,"img":"evcg_00_0","mirrow":false,"noOut":false,"trans":true},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":1000},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}